<title>DENMARK: Denmark's NIB expands 4.0 percent bond - Unibank.</title>
<headline>Denmark's NIB expands 4.0 percent bond - Unibank.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nordic Investment Bank will expand its 4.0 percent, six-year bond by 300 million crowns to 800 million crowns on May 2, lead Unibank said in a statement on Monday.  </p>
<p>It said that the bond was due to expire in 2003 and that it had been registered on Copenhagen Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
